{"title":"2011 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 10","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1_(Algebra)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1 (Algebra)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2_(Table)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2 (Table)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The taxi fare in Gotham City is $2.40 for the first <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/d/c/bdc960c165b21ba43f7a90caa2893d40409d6944.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"15\" height=\"38\" /> mile and additional mileage charged at the rate $0.20 for each additional 0.1 mile. You plan to give the driver a $2 tip. How many miles can you ride for $10?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/2/f/92fdf91cc1d2b295f76eefcd12712b60dc54a2b7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A) }3.0\\qquad\\textbf{(B) }3.25\\qquad\\textbf{(C) }3.3\\qquad\\textbf{(D) }3.5\\qquad\\textbf{(E) }3.75$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"441\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_1_.28Algebra.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1_(Algebra)\">Solution 1 (Algebra)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1 (Algebra)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> be the number of miles you ride. The number of miles you ride after the first half mile is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/1/b/a1b8fc6175c9dd1dffb716fdbed960dbc82b1174.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x-0.5.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"63\" height=\"15\" /> We can write this equation:\n</p><p><br />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/9/e/a9e685c931406d40e5fb512b02ec3ac3c446dfc9.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*} 10 &amp;= 2.4 + 0.2 \\times \\frac{x-0.5}{0.1} + 2\\\\ 5.6 &amp;= 2(x-0.5)\\\\ 2.8 &amp;= x-0.5\\\\ x &amp;= \\boxed{\\textbf{(C)}\\ 3.3}\\end{align*}\" width=\"228\" height=\"124\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_2_.28Table.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2_(Table)\">Solution 2 (Table)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2 (Table)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>\\begin{array}{|c|c|c|}\nMiles &amp; Money &amp; Remark\\\\\n\\hline\n0 &amp; 8 &amp; \\text{2  for  tip} \\\\\n\\hline\n0.5 &amp; 5.6 &amp; \\text{-2.4  for  first  0.5  mi} \\\\\n\\hline\n3.3 &amp; 0 &amp; \\text{-5.6  for  2.8  mi}\n\\end{array}\n</p><p>Miles travelled = <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/9/7/4972ac3383b2caee12e66d138ace5d886d38bc74.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(C)}\\ 3.3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"71\" height=\"30\" />\n</p><p>Solution by Anshulb, formatted by Cheetahboy93\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/2TYKNdpOvok\">https://youtu.be/2TYKNdpOvok</a>\n</p><p>~savannahsolver\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_8\" title=\"2011 AMC 8\">2011 AMC 8</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_8_Problems\" title=\"2011 AMC 8 Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_8_Answer_Key\" title=\"2011 AMC 8 Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" h